            <ArticleTitle>Tripod vibration anesthesia.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>20</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Cutaneous vibrators have been introduced to relieve pain associated with a variety of dermatology procedures including injections and laser treatments. The simple tripod massager described in this report is effective and acceptable to patients for cutaneous injection anesthesia.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
